  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "A. Semisolid LGI medium consisted of (quantities per litre): K2HPO4, 0.2g; KH2PO4, 0.6g; MgSO4 · 7H2O, 0.2g; CaCl2 · 2H2O, 0.02g; Na2MoO4 · 2H2O, 0.002g; FeCl3·6H2O,0.01g; bromothymol blue 0.5% solutionin 0.2N KOH, 5ml, agar, 1.8g; crystallized cane sugar, 100g; final pH 6.0."
